# Laioutr files
laioutrrc.json
# The bare rule above protects real project secrets wherever they land; test fixtures are synthetic
# and must be committed, or a fresh clone/CI silently loses them.
!test/fixtures/**/laioutrrc.json
# Same reasoning for the playground's own rc: synthetic demo data, no secrets, must be committed for
# `dev:prepare` to work on a fresh clone or in CI.
!playground/fixtures/laioutrrc.json

